WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.390
- Can you move your seat up?

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:02.190
 No.

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.685
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.176
[SEAT SQUEAKS]

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:15.730
 Thing is, you don't have to.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.380
I'm with you 'til the
end of the line, pal.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:27.770
 On your left.

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:31.440
On your left.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.240
 Uh-huh.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:35.390
On my left, got it.

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:36.210
Don't say it.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:37.560
Don't you say it.
- On your left.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:38.360
 Come on!

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:47.750
 Where's the fight?

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:53.550
 Payload secure.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:54.480
Thanks, Sam.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.110
 Don't thank me.

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:57.360
 I'm not thanking that thing.

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:58.520
 His name is Redwing.

00:00:58.520 --> 00:00:59.970
BLACK WIDOW: I'm
still not thanking it.

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:00.330
 He's cute.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:01.130
Go ahead, pet him.

00:01:05.261 --> 00:01:07.020
 I didn't kill your father.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:10.154
 Then why did you run?

00:01:10.154 --> 00:01:12.609
[THUDS]

00:01:12.609 --> 00:01:14.573
[GRUNT]

00:01:18.192 --> 00:01:18.992
[CRASH]

00:01:18.992 --> 00:01:20.465
[GRUNTING]

00:01:20.465 --> 00:01:22.440
[INTENSE MUSIC]

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:23.730
 He's inside my pack.

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:25.065
 Sorry.

00:01:25.065 --> 00:01:25.865
 Oh!

00:01:25.865 --> 00:01:27.360
 You seem like a
really great guy.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:36.765
 Ah, ah!

00:01:36.765 --> 00:01:38.745
[CRASH]

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:43.360
It's really important to me that
Cap never finds out about this.

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:50.760
 You couldn't have
done that earlier?

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:51.840
 I hate you.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:53.340
[CHIME]

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:58.490
[MUSIC PLAYING]

